       sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3>Ngrok Setup</h3>\n<p>You might meet the following error:</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/a14ae9d610289c9a4358f8a1a64e58ef/f3d76/ngrok_server_error.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 65.18987341772153%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"ngrok_server_error.png\"\n        title=\"ngrok_server_error.png\"\n        src=\"/static/a14ae9d610289c9a4358f8a1a64e58ef/f058b/ngrok_server_error.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/a14ae9d610289c9a4358f8a1a64e58ef/c26ae/ngrok_server_error.png 158w,\n/static/a14ae9d610289c9a4358f8a1a64e58ef/6bdcf/ngrok_server_error.png 315w,\n/static/a14ae9d610289c9a4358f8a1a64e58ef/f058b/ngrok_server_error.png 630w,\n/static/a14ae9d610289c9a4358f8a1a64e58ef/40601/ngrok_server_error.png 945w,\n/static/a14ae9d610289c9a4358f8a1a64e58ef/78612/ngrok_server_error.png 1260w,\n/static/a14ae9d610289c9a4358f8a1a64e58ef/f3d76/ngrok_server_error.png 3248w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>To fix this, you need to setup auth token:</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/cdaeac05f3fa46581f0795877cbac3e0/f3d76/ngrok_auth_setup.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 65.18987341772153%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"ngrok_auth_setup.png\"\n        title=\"ngrok_auth_setup.png\"\n        src=\"/static/cdaeac05f3fa46581f0795877cbac3e0/f058b/ngrok_auth_setup.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/cdaeac05f3fa46581f0795877cbac3e0/c26ae/ngrok_auth_setup.png 158w,\n/static/cdaeac05f3fa46581f0795877cbac3e0/6bdcf/ngrok_auth_setup.png 315w,\n/static/cdaeac05f3fa46581f0795877cbac3e0/f058b/ngrok_auth_setup.png 630w,\n/static/cdaeac05f3fa46581f0795877cbac3e0/40601/ngrok_auth_setup.png 945w,\n/static/cdaeac05f3fa46581f0795877cbac3e0/78612/ngrok_auth_setup.png 1260w,\n/static/cdaeac05f3fa46581f0795877cbac3e0/f3d76/ngrok_auth_setup.png 3248w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ ngrok config add-authtoken <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>your_auth_token<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\nAuthtoken saved to configuration file: /Users/xxx/.ngrok2/ngrok.yml\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Check the config file</span>\n$ <span class=\"token function\">cat</span> /Users/xxx/.ngrok2/ngrok.yml\nregion: us\nversion: <span class=\"token string\">'2'</span>\nauthtoken: <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>your_auth_token<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Restart the colab server:</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/9230ff77e0a564277eedbf37f6c2ce8e/f3d76/ngrok_server.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 65.18987341772153%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"ngrok_server.png\"\n        title=\"ngrok_server.png\"\n        src=\"/static/9230ff77e0a564277eedbf37f6c2ce8e/f058b/ngrok_server.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/9230ff77e0a564277eedbf37f6c2ce8e/c26ae/ngrok_server.png 158w,\n/static/9230ff77e0a564277eedbf37f6c2ce8e/6bdcf/ngrok_server.png 315w,\n/static/9230ff77e0a564277eedbf37f6c2ce8e/f058b/ngrok_server.png 630w,\n/static/9230ff77e0a564277eedbf37f6c2ce8e/40601/ngrok_server.png 945w,\n/static/9230ff77e0a564277eedbf37f6c2ce8e/78612/ngrok_server.png 1260w,\n/static/9230ff77e0a564277eedbf37f6c2ce8e/f3d76/ngrok_server.png 3248w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Installation Colab with Conda</h2>\n<h3><a href=\"https://repo.anaconda.com/miniconda/\">Conda install shells</a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ <span class=\"token function\">wget</span> https://repo.anaconda.com/miniconda/Miniconda3-latest-MacOSX-arm64.sh\n$ <span class=\"token function\">chmod</span> +x Miniconda3-latest-MacOSX-arm64.sh\n$ ./Miniconda3-latest-MacOSX-arm64.sh\n\nWelcome to Miniconda3 py310_23.3.1-0\n\nIn order to <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">continue</span> the installation process, please review the license\nagreement.\nPlease, press ENTER to <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">continue</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">>></span><span class=\"token operator\">></span> \n<span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span>\nEnd User License Agreement - Miniconda\n<span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">..</span>.\nPlease answer <span class=\"token string\">'yes'</span> or <span class=\"token string\">'no'</span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">:</span><span class=\"token string\">'\n>>> yes\n\nMiniconda3 will now be installed into this location:\n/Users/xxx/miniconda3\n\n  - Press ENTER to confirm the location\n  - Press CTRL-C to abort the installation\n  - Or specify a different location below\n\n[/Users/xxx/miniconda3] >>>\nPREFIX=/Users/xxx/miniconda3\nUnpacking payload ...\n...\nby running conda init? [yes|no]\n[yes] >>> yes\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/condabin/conda\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/bin/conda\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/bin/conda-env\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/bin/activate\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/bin/deactivate\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/etc/fish/conf.d/conda.fish\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/shell/condabin/Conda.psm1\nmodified      /Users/xxx/miniconda3/shell/condabin/conda-hook.ps1\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/lib/python3.10/site-packages/xontrib/conda.xsh\nno change     /Users/xxx/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.csh\nmodified      /Users/xxx/.zshrc\n\n==> For changes to take effect, close and re-open your current shell. &lt;==\n\nIf you'</span>d prefer that conda's base environment not be activated on startup, \n   <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">set</span> the auto_activate_base parameter to false: \n\nconda config <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--set</span> auto_activate_base <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span>\n\nThank you <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> installing Miniconda3<span class=\"token operator\">!</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>Create and avtivate a new environment</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ conda create <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-y</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-n</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>env_name<span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">python</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3.11</span>\n$ conda activate <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>env_name<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h3>Install google colab</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ conda <span class=\"token function\">install</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-c</span> conda-forge google-colab</code></pre></div>\n<h3>Activate your conda environment.</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">$ python <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-m</span> ipykernel <span class=\"token function\">install</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--user</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--name</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>env_name<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Warnings</h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">Installing collected packages: pip\n  WARNING: The scripts pip, pip3, pip3.10 and pip3.9 are installed <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token string\">'/Users/xxx/Library/Python/3.9/bin'</span> <span class=\"token function\">which</span> is not on <span class=\"token environment constant\">PATH</span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">.</span>\n  Consider adding this directory to <span class=\"token environment constant\">PATH</span> or, <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> you prefer to suppress this warning, use --no-warn-script-location.\nSuccessfully installed pip-23.1.2\nWARNING: You are using pip version <span class=\"token number\">21.2</span>.4<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> however, version <span class=\"token number\">23.1</span>.2 is available.\nYou should consider upgrading via the <span class=\"token string\">'/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin/python3 -m pip install --upgrade pip'</span> command.</code></pre></div>\n<p>I’ve seen this warning when installing <code class=\"language-text\">pip</code> with <code class=\"language-text\">pip3</code>. And it’s because the <code class=\"language-text\">pip</code> executable is installed in a directory that is not on your <code class=\"language-text\">PATH</code>.\nThere are three duplicate <code class=\"language-text\">pip</code> executables installed on my system:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>/opt/homebrew/bin/python3</li>\n<li>/Users/xxx/Library/Python/3.9/bin</li>\n<li>/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer/usr/bin/python3</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you see this warning, you can add the following to your <code class=\"language-text\">~/.zshrc</code> file:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\"><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">export</span> <span class=\"token assign-left variable\"><span class=\"token environment constant\">PATH</span></span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/opt/homebrew/bin/python3:<span class=\"token environment constant\">$PATH</span>\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://towardsdatascience.com/colabcode-deploying-machine-learning-models-from-google-colab-54e0d37a7b09\">https://towardsdatascience.com/colabcode-deploying-machine-learning-models-from-google-colab-54e0d37a7b09</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://medium.com/analytics-vidhya/colab-vs-code-github-jupyter-perfect-for-deep-learning-2b257ae94d01\">https://medium.com/analytics-vidhya/colab-vs-code-github-jupyter-perfect-for-deep-learning-2b257ae94d01</a></li>\n</ol>","frontmatter":{"title":"Getting started with colab + vscode","date":"May 10, 2023","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/debug-laravel-app/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Debug laravel app"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/colab-vs-jupyter/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"What's the difference between Colab and Jupyter?"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"d379257a-b574-5eeb-8d71-676eee86db7f","previousPostId":"38faa01b-682b-5e71-8956-5804d5d4aa7f","nextPostId":"0e1a7dfe-a03b-5f70-b65e-3a05113164d1"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383","3257411868"]}